实验数据来源说明（不影响代码许可，数据版权归原机构）：
- AME2020 / NUBASE2020: IAEA, https://www-nds.iaea.org/amdc/
- 电荷半径: Angeli & Marinova, Table of experimental nuclear ground state
  charge radii (2013), 经 IAEA 镜像分发
- 电四极矩: N. J. Stone, IAEA recommended electric quadrupole moments (2016)
